$formatEggs=function($eggs,$perTray){$trays=intdiv((int)round($eggs),$perTray);$loose=(int)round($eggs)%$perTray;return $trays.'T'.($loose?'/'.$loose.'E':'');};
$salesByMethod=$snapshot['sales']->groupBy(fn($sale)=>Str::lower($sale->payment_type)==='credit' ? 'credit' : Str::lower($sale->payment_method ?: $sale->payment_type));
$prepaymentsToday=$snapshot['prepayments']->where('received_date',$date);
$receivedToday=$snapshot['payments']->sum('amount')+$prepaymentsToday->sum('amount');
$banked=$snapshot['payments']->filter(fn($p)=>in_array(Str::lower($p->payment_method),['bank','bank_transfer','cheque'],true))->sum('amount')+$prepaymentsToday->filter(fn($p)=>in_array(Str::lower($p->payment_method),['bank','bank_transfer','cheque'],true))->sum('amount');
$cash=$snapshot['payments']->where('payment_method','cash')->sum('amount')+$prepaymentsToday->where('payment_method','cash')->sum('amount');
$expenses=$snapshot['transactions']->where('type','money_paid');
$cheques=$snapshot['all_transactions']->filter(fn($t)=>$t->type==='money_paid'&&(Str::contains(Str::lower($t->payment_method),'bank')||Str::contains(Str::lower($t->reference),'chq')||Str::contains(Str::lower($t->reference),'cheque')))->groupBy('account');
$chequeAccounts=$snapshot['account_balances']->pluck('account')->merge($cheques->keys())->filter()->unique();
@endphp
